        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Cosmopolitan, Cuba Libre, Manhattan, Old Fashioned, Mojito\n- Roles: Bartender\n- Concepts: Cocktails, cocktail ingredients\n\nFacts:\n- The Cosmopolitan, also called a cosmo, is a cocktail made with vodka, triple sec, cranberry juice, and freshly squeezed or sweetened lime juice.\n- The Cuba Libre, meaning \"Free Cuba,\" is a caffeinated alcoholic cocktail made with cola, lime, and dark or light rum.\n- A bartender can generally mix classic cocktails such as the Cosmopolitan, Manhattan, Old Fashioned, and Mojito.",
